      "text": "[7:10PM] #Badagry #TrafficUpdate \n\nThere is free flow of traffic from Agbara Custom Checkpoint to Morogbo Bus Stop inward Badagry. \nThe return route toward Ijanikin is also clear.\nVehicular movement remains smooth from Morogbo through Ajibade, Odofa, Exodus Car Wash, Ibiye, Magbon, and down to Okoafo. Likewise, traffic is moving well from Okoafo through Elijah, Atura, Age-Mowo, Mowo, Aradagun, Torikoh Bus Stop, and onward to Badagry Roundabout.\nOverall, the entire stretch across the axis is free of obstruction, and traffic is flowing seamlessly. Officers are fully on ground and actively managing the situation.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
