      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1950984517520347462",
      "text": "[7:16PM] #PWD #TrafficUpdate \n\nThere’s a good traffic flow inward National via Ikeja Bypass, both on the overpass and underpass.\nMovement from Bolade-Oshodi through Shogunle, Ladipo, and enroute PWD is also smooth.\nTraffic is slightly heavy at the Airport turning toward National, while the Ikeja Flyover remains calm.\nFrom Ikeja Overpass to Ajayi Farm, traffic is light. Movement from Ile Zik through Mongoro, Cement, and toward Dopemu under the bridge is good, though approaching Dopemu Bridge is busy due to high influx. \nThe return journey from Dopemu underpass back to Bolade Junction is smooth, with no major concerns.\nTraffic officers are actively on ground ensuring effective control.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
