      "text": "[7:41PM] #LekkiPeninsula #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is smooth from Lekki Peninsula Gate1 to the Lekki-Ikoyi Link Bridge roundabout. However, the route is slightly busy inward and outward from Farm City, due to a high influx of vehicles on the main carriageway around the Lekki intersection.\nMovement from the Lekki-Ikoyi Link Bridge roundabout to Alexander Avenue is steady in both directions.\nThe stretch between the Lekki-Ikoyi Link Bridge roundabout and Zenith is also clear inward and outward.\nTraffic from Dome to VFS is flowing well, and VFS to the Ikate intersection remains free in both directions.\nNo obstructions have been observed at the moment.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
