      "text": "[8:06PM] #Maryland_Ikeja #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic flow is smooth along the service lane from Anthony through Maryland intersection, extending to Odo'yalaro and Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way.\nVehicular movement remains steady around Leventis, NITEL, Sheraton, and inw Customs.\nHowever, there’s slight congestion from Customs to Kodesoh Road heading toward Awolowo Way.\nThe return route remains free-flowing along Oba Akran Road and Kodesoh Road, continuing through the General Hospital underbridge, Local Airport Road, Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way, Oba Akinjobi Way, and inw Ikeja G.R.A.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
