      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1951003323546608086",
      "text": "[8:25PM] #Dopemu #TrafficUpdate \n\nCurrently, there is a good movement from Agbotikuyo through Swipha down to Akowonjo Roundabout, connecting smoothly to Shasha Traffic Light. \nSimilarly, traffic from Vulcanizer Bus Stop through Ogunlana Junction to Egbeda is flowing well.\nMovement from Cement to Iyana Ipaja is also good, with the return journey from Goye Junction through Akinwowo Junction down to Alaguntan Junction experiencing smooth flow. \nTraffic officers are fully on ground managing the situation effectively, and no impediments have been reported at the moment.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
