    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1951003944681087057",
      "url": "https://x.com/HalifaxWater/status/1951003944681087057",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/HalifaxWater/status/1951003944681087057",
      "text": "Traffic Advisory – Chebucto Road - Connaught Avenue – Water System Upgrades\n\nBeginning on Tuesday, August 5th until Thursday, August 7th, Dexter Construction on behalf of Halifax Water will complete an upgrade to the water transmission main along Chebucto Road and Newton Avenue. This upgrade will be completed during the night. \n\nTypical nighttime work hours will be 6:00 PM to 7:00 AM.\nDuring this nightwork portion of the project, the following traffic control will be in place:\n· Alternating lane closures on Chebucto Road\n· Alternating lane closures inbound on Connaught Avenue between Berlin Street and Chebucto Road.\n· Sidewalks in the work zone will be closed. Pedestrian traffic will be diverted to the opposite side of the street.\n\nPlease note work will continue during the day to complete reinstatement work. \n\nhttps://t.co/UT3CTtbw3Q",
